# Creeping bramble (#364), native 16x24 frames, rooted on the LEFT (a wall face at x < 0; flip for a right root).
# Clump frames: rest (tips showing), rustle1 (first tip pokes), rustle2 (canes shift, two tips); arm frames: cane1 and
# cane2 (a repeating 32 px wavy segment) and tip (the end hook). Thorn family language: magenta cane, bone tips, ink contour.
